# Where the site lives. Not secret. brainrotgame.shop is the front door for the games and sits on the
# same droplet as Bag Brawl, Deadpoint and Heads Up (SFO3). It has no server of its own: Caddy serves
# the files straight off disk, and there is no build step, so a deploy is a copy.
DEPLOY_HOST=root@24.199.123.123
# Hostname Caddy serves HTTPS for. Needs A records at Porkbun pointing brainrotgame.shop (and www) at
# the droplet; Caddy fetches the certificate itself once they resolve.
PUBLIC_HOST=brainrotgame.shop
